program	enum145_raw_unbacked_cast_error.saw
triple	arm64-apple-darwin
twin	same
expect	error
build	refused	enum `Plain` has no backing type, so it cannot be cast to `UInt8`
meets_expect	yes
log	"error: enum `Plain` has no backing type, so it cannot be cast to `UInt8`"
log	"  --> examples/enum145_raw_unbacked_cast_error.saw:15:13"
log	"     |"
log	" 15 |     print(p as UInt8)"
log	"     |             ^"
log	"   hint: declare one (`enum Plain: UInt8 { case A = 0, ... }`) to pin the case values; without it the tag values are not part of the type"
log	""
log	"1 error(s) generated"
